<article class="env-lemma" id="0F6W">
  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/0F6W">Lemma <span data-tag="0F6W">37.64.15</span>.</a> Let $U \to X$ be a weakly étale morphism of schemes where $X$ is a scheme in characteristic $p$. Then the relative Frobenius $F_{U/X} : U \to U \times _{X, F_ X} X$ is an isomorphism. </p>
</article><article class="env-proof">
    <p>
      <strong>Proof.</strong>
      The morphism $F_{U/X}$ is a universal homeomorphism by Varieties, Lemma <a href="/tag/0CCB" data-tag="0CCB">33.36.6</a>. The morphism $F_{U/X}$ is weakly étale as a morphism between schemes weakly étale over $X$ by Lemma <a href="/tag/0951" data-tag="0951">37.64.13</a>. Hence $F_{U/X}$ is an isomorphism by Lemma <a href="/tag/0F6V" data-tag="0F6V">37.64.14</a>. 
      <span class="qed">$\square$</span>
    </p>
</article>